    contenu:
      "Whether it is a daycare centre, a day-care family, an au pair girl or boy, a private preschool or a babysitting service, there are many childcare options available alongside care provided within the family.\n\nBut who should you trust to look after your child? What about care hours and costs? What are the waiting times, and how flexible are the offers? Who can benefit from subsidies, and how much?\n\nHere you will find information on the various childcare options and systems, as well as the addresses of institutions near you.",
