    contenu:
      "Haven't found an apprenticeship place yet? Then sign up for Check-In!\n\nSRC Check-In allows you to gain concrete work experience through practical placements in healthcare and nursing home facilities. The available fields of activity are:\n\n• Care\n• Support\n• Housekeeping\n• Catering\n• Maintenance\n• Administration\n\nSRC Check-In is aimed at young people aged 15 to 19 who hold a lower secondary school diploma, at any level, and who have not yet found an apprenticeship place or who have interrupted their apprenticeship. The programme lasts 6 to 12 months and includes 75% practical work in a company and 25% training, i.e. one day per week. The programme starts after the summer holidays.\n\nIf needed, Check-In provides experienced professionals who personally mentor young people in their search for an apprenticeship place.\n\nFor more information, contact the Swiss Red Cross Training Centre.",
